{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫劇《璀璨之城》昨晚（19日）第6集劇情緊湊，既有令人心寒兼緊張刺激的權鬥，亦有令人心痛和感動場口。</p><p>昨晚焦點劇情講述，孝君（吳卓羲飾）當選主席後， 與哥哥（張智霖飾）表面和平，但演變成更激烈明爭暗鬥。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.546990+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T05:20:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T22:17:35.282339+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684322+00:00","content_hash":"3ef98d7486f81d0b85da5316706dac3c9bf5847716ffb6814ac2114c879b4b8a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}